          "label": "Code Summary",
          "content": "Item | Requirement | Provided\nCode | 2021 IBC, 2021 IFC, 2021 IECC, 2017 ICC A117.1 | —\nConstruction type | II-B | II-B\nAllowable height (A-3, S) | 75 ft / 3 stories | 34 ft / 2 stories\nAllowable area per floor (A-3, S1) | 38,000 SF | 18,000 SF\nSprinklers | Required (A-3 > 12,000 SF) | NFPA 13 throughout\nFire alarm | Manual + automatic, voice evac (A-3 > 300 occ.) | Provided\nExits required (Level 1) | 2 min (occupant load > 49); 3 if > 500 | 4\nExits required (Level 2) | 2 min | 2 stairs\nMax travel distance | 250 ft (A-3, sprinklered) | 168 ft\nPlumbing fixtures (A-3) | See P101 calculation | See P101",
