          "@type": "Table",
          "label": "Occupant Load",
          "content": "Room | Name | Area (SF) | Function | Load factor (SF/occ) | Occupants\n102 | Lobby | 1000 | Assembly, waiting | 15 | 67\n103 | Circulation Desk | 700 | Business | 150 | 5\n104 | Children's Library | 3300 | Library reading / stack (avg.) | 50 | 66\n105 | Story Time Room | 750 | Assembly, unconcentrated (tables & chairs) | 15 | 50\n106 | Community Room | 1575 | Assembly, unconcentrated (tables & chairs) | 15 | 105\n107 | Kitchenette | 375 | Assembly, unconcentrated | 15 | 25\n111 | Staff Workroom | 900 | Business | 150 | 6\n112 | Branch Manager Office | 375 | Business | 150 | 3\n113 | Book Return / Sorting | 400 | Business | 150 | 3\n114 | Mechanical | 750 | Accessory storage / mech. | 300 | 3\n115 | Electrical | 400 | Accessory storage / mech. | 300 | 2\n120 | Community Storage | 150 | Accessory storage / mech. | 300 | 1\n121 | Reading Room | 3250 | Library reading / stack (avg.) | 50 | 65\n122 | Local History Room | 630 | Library reading / stack (avg.) | 50 | 13\n201 | Adult Collection | 3850 | Library reading / stack (avg.) | 50 | 77\n202 | Teen Zone | 1925 | Library reading / stack (avg.) | 50 | 39\n203 | Quiet Reading | 2250 | Library reading / stack (avg.) | 50 | 45\n204 | Study Room 1 | 180 | Educational, classroom | 20 | 9\n205 | Study Room 2 | 180 | Educational, classroom | 20 | 9\n206 | Study Room 3 | 180 | Educational, classroom | 20 | 9\n207 | Study Room 4 | 180 | Educational, classroom | 20 | 9\n208 | Makerspace | 1530 | Educational, shops / vocational | 50 | 31\n209 | Computer Lab | 1275 | Educational, classroom | 20 | 64\n212 | Staff Break Room | 780 | Assembly, unconcentrated | 15 | 52\n213 | IT / Data | 750 | Accessory storage / mech. | 300 | 3\n218 | Open Commons | 1400 | Library reading / stack (avg.) | 50 | 28\n219 | Genealogy Archive | 900 | Library reading / stack (avg.) | 50 | 18\n | Level 1 total |  |  |  | 414\n | Level 2 total |  |  |  | 393\n | Building total |  |  |  | 807",
          "bbox": [
