          "content": "Type | Description | Thickness | Rating | Acoustic / Thermal\n1 | Exterior: brick veneer, 2\" air space, 2\" rigid insulation, air barrier, 8\" CMU | 13-5/8\" | — | R-15 c.i.\n2 | Interior partition: 3-5/8\" mtl stud, 5/8\" GWB each side, to 6\" above ceiling | 4-7/8\" | — | —\n3 | Acoustic partition: 3-5/8\" mtl stud, batt insulation, 5/8\" GWB each side, to deck | 4-7/8\" | — | STC 50\n4 | 1-hr shaft wall: 2-1/2\" CH stud, 1\" liner, 2 layers 5/8\" Type X GWB | 4-3/4\" | 1 hr (UL U415) | —\n5 | 2-hr stair enclosure: 8\" CMU, fully grouted at bond beams | 7-5/8\" | 2 hr (UL U905) | —",
          "bbox": [
            1800,
            900,
            2190,
            1250
          ]
        }
      ],
      "notes": [
        {
          "@id": "urn:uuid:1a601b73-cb2f-591e-b1d8-e086a23106bf",
          "@type": "Note",
          "content": "GENERAL NOTES:\n1. All dimensions are to face of stud or face of CMU unless noted otherwise.\n2. Verify all dimensions in field prior to fabrication of millwork and storefront.\n3. Provide fire-treated wood blocking at all wall-mounted shelving, casework, grab bars, and accessories.\n4. All interior partitions are type 2 unless noted otherwise. See wall types on this sheet.\n5. Coordinate floor box locations with furniture plan FP-101 (by owner).\n6. Door frames are 4\" from adjacent wall unless dimensioned otherwise.",
          "bbox": [
            1800,
            110,
            2190,
            420
          ]
        },
        {
          "@id": "urn:uuid:99cb0d05-21d4-5e9a-acb3-b6aa8d2a38d8",
          "@type": "Note",
          "content": "KEYNOTES: 4.01 Brick veneer over CMU; 8.12 Aluminum storefront entry; 8.44 Curtain wall; 10.21 Toilet partitions; 11.31 Appliances by owner; 12.36 Quartz countertop; 14.21 Hydraulic elevator.",
          "bbox": [
            1800,
            440,
            2190,
            650
          ]
        }
      ],
      "images": [
        {
