        {
          "@id": "urn:uuid:59976371-2b08-5e75-83f8-3e36618126ce",
          "@type": "Table",
          "label": "Hardware Sets",
          "content": "Set | Description | Components\n1 | Exterior entry pair | Continuous hinges, rim exit devices w/ lever trim, card reader (ACS), auto operator, closers, threshold, weatherstrip\n2 | Vestibule interior pair | Continuous hinges, push/pull, closers, auto operator, wall stops\n3 | Interior pair, public | Hinges (3 per leaf), flush bolts, storeroom lockset, closers, wall stops, magnetic holders tied to FA\n4 | Office / room | Hinges (3), office lockset, wall stop, silencers\n5 | Multi-user restroom | Hinges (3), push/pull, closer, kick plate, privacy indicator deadbolt\n6 | Service / rated | Hinges (3), storeroom lockset, closer, smoke seals (rated doors), kick plate\n7 | Single-user restroom | Hinges (3), privacy lockset w/ indicator, closer, kick plate, coat hook\n8 | Overhead coiling | Motor operator, key switch, photo eyes, bottom astragal",
          "bbox": [
            1550,
            100,
            2150,
            700
          ]
        },
        {
