          "label": "Window Schedule",
          "content": "Type | Description | Width | Height | Glazing | Frame\nW1 | Fixed curtain wall unit | 5'-0\" | 10'-0\" | Insulated low-E, U-0.30, SHGC 0.25 | AL-1\nW2 | Fixed punched window w/ awning vent | 4'-0\" | 6'-0\" | Insulated low-E, U-0.32, SHGC 0.27 | AL-1\nW3 | Clerestory ribbon window | 8'-0\" | 2'-6\" | Insulated low-E, fritted, U-0.30 | AL-1\nW4 | Storefront sidelite | 2'-0\" | 8'-0\" | Insulated low-E, tempered | AL-2",
          "bbox": [
