          "label": "Door Types",
          "content": "Type | Description | Notes\nA | Flush wood, solid core | Plain sliced white oak veneer, factory finish\nB | Aluminum storefront pair | Medium stile, 1\" insulated low-E glass\nC | Flush hollow metal | 18 ga, painted; rated per schedule\nD | Wood w/ narrow vision lite | 5\" x 33\" lite, tempered glass\nE | Overhead coiling | Insulated steel slats, 8'-0\" x 8'-0\"\nF | Wood pair w/ full vision lites | Tempered glass, 6'-0\" x 7'-0\" pair",
