          "content": "GENERAL NOTES:\n1. Fire-rated doors and frames shall bear UL labels.\n2. Wood doors: AWI premium grade, factory finished.\n3. All hollow metal frames welded, 16 ga; 14 ga at exterior and rated openings.\n4. Coordinate access control at hardware set 1 with security vendor.",
