    {
      "@id": "urn:uuid:ac3e70be-f2ba-50d5-8f04-330b290dd166",
      "@type": "Sheet",
      "sheetNumber": "S001",
      "title": "General Structural Notes",
      "pageIndex": 11,
      "tables": [
        {
          "@id": "urn:uuid:b44738c5-8099-56e0-8a02-f4b93e145b0d",
          "@type": "Table",
          "label": "Design Loads",
          "content": "Load | Value | Notes\nRoof live | 20 psf | Reducible\nRoof snow (Pg) | 30 psf | Ce 1.0, Ct 1.0, Is 1.1\nFloor live - stacks | 150 psf | Library stack areas, nonreducible\nFloor live - reading rooms | 60 psf | \nFloor live - corridors above first floor | 80 psf | \nSuperimposed dead | 15 psf floor / 12 psf roof | MEP, ceilings, finishes\nWind | 115 mph (Vult), Exposure C | Risk Category III\nSeismic | SDC B, Site Class D | Ss 0.12, S1 0.06, Ie 1.25\nAllowable soil bearing | 3,000 psf | Per geotechnical report GR-26-118",
          "bbox": [
            100,
            100,
            1100,
            700
          ]
        }
      ],
      "notes": [
        {
          "@id": "urn:uuid:95059aa6-faec-5a7d-bb20-a9f136962c6a",
          "@type": "Note",
          "content": "GENERAL NOTES:\n1. Design per 2021 IBC and ASCE 7-16. Risk Category III (assembly > 300 occupants).\n2. Concrete: f'c = 4,000 psi at 28 days for footings and slabs; 5,000 psi for exterior exposed.\n3. Reinforcing steel: ASTM A615 Grade 60.\n4. Structural steel: wide flange ASTM A992; HSS ASTM A500 Grade C; plates and angles ASTM A36.\n5. Steel deck: ASTM A653, galvanized G60.\n6. Masonry: f'm = 2,000 psi; Type S mortar; grout 3,000 psi.\n7. Special inspections required per IBC Chapter 17; see statement of special inspections.\n8. Contractor to submit shop drawings for steel, joists, deck, and reinforcing prior to fabrication.",
          "bbox": [
            1150,
            100,
            2150,
            900
          ]
        }
      ],
      "images": [
        {
