          "@type": "Table",
          "label": "Rooftop Unit Schedule",
          "content": "Tag | Serves | Supply CFM | OA CFM | Cooling (tons) | Heating | EER / IEER | Elec | Weight\nRTU-1 | Level 1 west | 9,000 | 2,100 | 25 | Gas, 400 MBH | 11.0 / 15.2 | 460V/3ph, 52 MCA | 3,850 lb\nRTU-2 | Level 1 east + community | 8,500 | 2,600 | 25 | Gas, 400 MBH | 11.0 / 15.2 | 460V/3ph, 52 MCA | 3,850 lb\nRTU-3 | Level 2 | 12,000 | 2,800 | 30 | Gas, 480 MBH | 10.8 / 14.9 | 460V/3ph, 64 MCA | 4,400 lb",
          "bbox": [
