          "@type": "Table",
          "label": "VAV Box Schedule - Level 1",
          "content": "Tag | Serves | Max CFM | Min CFM | Reheat\nVAV-1-01 | 101 Vestibule | 200 | 50 | HW coil\nVAV-1-02 | 102 Lobby | 1500 | 450 | HW coil\nVAV-1-03 | 103 Circulation Desk | 700 | 200 | None\nVAV-1-04 | 104 Children's Library | 3300 | 1000 | HW coil\nVAV-1-05 | 105 Story Time Room | 1125 | 350 | None\nVAV-1-06 | 106 Community Room | 2375 | 725 | None\nVAV-1-07 | 107 Kitchenette | 575 | 175 | None\nVAV-1-11 | 111 Staff Workroom | 900 | 275 | None\nVAV-1-12 | 112 Branch Manager Office | 375 | 125 | None\nVAV-1-13 | 113 Book Return / Sorting | 400 | 125 | None\nVAV-1-20 | 120 Community Storage | 150 | 50 | None\nVAV-1-21 | 121 Reading Room | 3250 | 975 | HW coil\nVAV-1-22 | 122 Local History Room | 625 | 200 | None\nVAV-1-23 | 123 Corridor | 450 | 125 | None",
          "bbox": [
