          "content": "Tag | Serves | CFM | ESP (in. wg) | HP | Type\nEF-1 | Restrooms L1 + L2 | 1,600 | 0.75 | 1/2 | Roof upblast\nEF-2 | Makerspace laser cutter | 600 | 1.5 | 3/4 | Inline, spark resistant\nEF-3 | Janitor / storage | 300 | 0.5 | 1/6 | Ceiling cabinet",
