          "@type": "Table",
          "label": "Plumbing Fixture Schedule",
          "content": "Tag | Fixture | Mounting | Trim | Quantity (L1)\nWC-1 | Water closet | Wall hung, 1.28 gpf | Sensor flush valve | 6\nWC-2 | Water closet, accessible | Wall hung, 17-19\" rim | Sensor flush valve | 3\nUR-1 | Urinal | Wall hung, 0.125 gpf | Sensor | 2\nLAV-1 | Lavatory | Solid surface countertop | Sensor faucet, 0.5 gpm | 6\nLAV-2 | Lavatory, accessible | Wall hung | Sensor faucet, 0.5 gpm | 1\nSK-1 | Kitchen sink | Double bowl SS | Gooseneck, 1.5 gpm | 1\nSK-2 | Work sink | Single bowl SS | Gooseneck, 1.5 gpm | 1\nMS-1 | Mop sink | Floor, 24x24 | Service faucet w/ vac breaker | 1\nDF-1 | Drinking fountain + bottle filler | Hi-lo, wall mounted | Filtered, chilled | 1",
